So...

254
00:15:45,777 --> 00:15:47,777
I was hoping to hear it from your perspective.

255
00:15:48,777 --> 00:15:51,777
What inspired you to move so far away from your own world?

256
00:15:52,777 --> 00:15:54,777
I'd appreciate it if you told me yourself.

257
00:15:55,777 --> 00:15:56,777
You know, whenever you feel like talking...

258
00:15:56,777 --> 00:16:01,777
It's cool.

259
00:16:02,777 --> 00:16:03,777
You don't have to force yourself.

260
00:16:04,777 --> 00:16:06,777
If you don't want to talk about it, I totally understand.

261
00:16:07,777 --> 00:16:08,777
Promise.

262
00:16:12,777 --> 00:16:13,777
Do you want to know?

263
00:16:14,777 --> 00:16:15,777
Mm-hmm.

264
00:16:15,777 --> 00:16:19,777
There's magic to look like a human?

265
00:16:23,777 --> 00:16:24,777
You did it on the first try?

266
00:16:25,777 --> 00:16:27,777
You really are a genius, aren't you?

267
00:16:27,777 --> 00:16:28,777
Good job.

268
00:16:29,777 --> 00:16:32,777
Your father said he wants you to go to all sorts of places, wherever that may be.

269
00:16:34,777 --> 00:16:35,777
I wonder...

270
00:16:36,777 --> 00:16:39,777
Does the Emperor of Demise want his daughter to become a spectator?

271
00:16:39,777 --> 00:16:44,777
That was that. The day I started my journey.

272
00:16:48,777 --> 00:16:50,777
Humans were everywhere I went.

273
00:16:53,777 --> 00:16:54,777
People are so foolish.

274
00:16:55,777 --> 00:16:56,777
They're fighting today as well.

275
00:16:57,777 --> 00:17:00,777
It's a constant battle over things like land or authority.

276
00:17:01,777 --> 00:17:04,777
But they also create a bunch of interesting things.

277
00:17:05,777 --> 00:17:07,777
That was my first impression.

278
00:17:07,777 --> 00:17:08,777
Well, as a dragon.

279
00:17:12,777 --> 00:17:13,777
Why is it Toru?

280
00:17:13,777 --> 00:17:14,777
I'm Toru.

281
00:17:15,777 --> 00:17:16,777
Toru?

282
00:17:17,777 --> 00:17:18,777
Close enough.

283
00:17:19,777 --> 00:17:20,777
Your name's Kana, isn't it?

284
00:17:21,777 --> 00:17:22,777
You used magic to become a human, too.

285
00:17:23,777 --> 00:17:24,777
Why?

286
00:17:24,777 --> 00:17:26,777
There are lots of exciting things to do with human hands.

287
00:17:27,777 --> 00:17:28,777
I like pranks.

288
00:17:31,777 --> 00:17:33,777
Is that the previous Kana Kamali?

289
00:17:35,777 --> 00:17:36,777
What kind of pranks?

290
00:17:37,777 --> 00:17:38,777
Collecting bugs and stuff.

291
00:17:39,777 --> 00:17:40,777
That's not a real prank.

292
00:17:45,777 --> 00:17:46,777
I want attention from you.

293
00:17:50,777 --> 00:17:53,777
They probably didn't have time for you while they were preparing for battle.

294
00:17:54,777 --> 00:17:58,777
They usually only clash once every few centuries, if at all.

295
00:17:59,777 --> 00:18:01,777
I'm not interested in fighting.

296
00:18:02,777 --> 00:18:04,777
Because you're a coward, Quetzalcoatl.

297
00:18:05,777 --> 00:18:07,777
You're strong but refuse to participate in battles.

298
00:18:08,777 --> 00:18:09,777
I don't like to fight.

299
00:18:10,777 --> 00:18:11,777
What do you want from me?

300
00:18:11,777 --> 00:18:13,777
Looking in from the outside, it's so pointless.

301
00:18:14,777 --> 00:18:15,777
Toru, love.

302
00:18:15,777 --> 00:18:18,777
You should quit the Chaos Faction.

303
00:18:21,777 --> 00:18:23,777
I'm the daughter of the Emperor of Demise.

304
00:18:24,777 --> 00:18:25,777
The representative of the Chaos Faction.

305
00:18:26,777 --> 00:18:29,777
If I were to run, then my father's position would be in jeopardy.

306
00:18:30,777 --> 00:18:31,777
Absurd.

307
00:18:32,777 --> 00:18:36,777
If you can't live your life the way you want, then you fail as a dragon.

308
00:18:37,777 --> 00:18:40,777
The fact that you were put in that position by others must be aggravating.

309
00:18:41,777 --> 00:18:42,777
Is that how it works?

310
00:18:42,777 --> 00:18:45,777
You may be a dragon, but you live too selflessly.

311
00:18:46,777 --> 00:18:49,777
If anyone stands in the way of what you want, kill them.

312
00:18:50,777 --> 00:18:51,777
Even if they're your parents.

313
00:18:52,777 --> 00:18:54,777
That's what dragons do.

314
00:18:55,777 --> 00:18:56,777
Pretty extreme.

315
00:19:02,777 --> 00:19:03,777
Toru.

316
00:19:04,777 --> 00:19:06,777
I can't continue on this journey with you.

317
00:19:08,777 --> 00:19:09,777
We have to end it.

318
00:19:10,777 --> 00:19:11,777
Right.

319
00:19:11,777 --> 00:19:12,777
No hard feelings.

320
00:19:14,777 --> 00:19:16,777
You do make a good point, and I understand what you mean.

321
00:19:17,777 --> 00:19:19,777
I guess it's possible that I've been used by others, too.

322
00:19:20,777 --> 00:19:22,777
I don't agree, of course. I'm not a complete fool.

323
00:19:24,777 --> 00:19:25,777
Prayers are precious resources.

324
00:19:26,777 --> 00:19:29,777
Which is why I think it had felt so good to focus on helping humans.

325
00:19:30,777 --> 00:19:31,777
You got to eat your fill, too.

326
00:19:34,777 --> 00:19:35,777
Thank you, Toru.

327
00:19:36,777 --> 00:19:37,777
I had such fun with you.

328
00:19:38,777 --> 00:19:40,777
I'm glad it was your decision to travel with me.

329
00:19:41,777 --> 00:19:42,777
I'll never forget.

330
00:19:42,777 --> 00:19:51,777
But it wasn't. I couldn't choose anything.

331
00:19:51,777 --> 00:19:52,777
I just... didn't like it. The lack of freedom.

332
00:19:52,777 --> 00:20:01,777
I didn't want the Chaos Faction and Harmony Faction to fight each other.

333
00:20:01,777 --> 00:20:02,777
That was never my will.

334
00:20:02,777 --> 00:20:04,777
It felt good having a friend so close that we could spar.

335
00:20:05,777 --> 00:20:06,777
I respect my father.

336
00:20:07,777 --> 00:20:11,777
But the chains of being the Emperor of Demise's daughter are way too heavy.

337
00:20:11,777 --> 00:20:24,777
I want to live freely. I want to be on my own. I am a dragon. So I'll fight and win my independence.

338
00:20:24,777 --> 00:20:34,777
The factions don't matter. This is my personal fight. I'm going to wipe these guys out and break all the chains clinging to dragons.

339
00:20:34,777 --> 00:20:41,777
I'm going to be free. I'm going to be free. And then... And then...

340
00:20:41,777 --> 00:20:52,777
I didn't have anything. Once I was alone, I found there was nothing I wanted to do.

341
00:20:52,777 --> 00:21:09,777
Being on my own. Being free. Was so... terrifying.

342
00:21:09,777 --> 00:21:18,777
That's how I remember it. I was afraid to be free until you showed up and took my hand. You made me feel like I wasn't alone.

343
00:21:19,777 --> 00:21:24,777
Uh, cool. I was never interested in anything until after I moved to the big city.

344
00:21:25,777 --> 00:21:27,777
I know who I am now.

345
00:21:27,777 --> 00:21:28,777
What?

346
00:21:30,777 --> 00:21:31,777
Miss Kobayashi.

347
00:21:33,777 --> 00:21:36,777
I see that. I've always wanted to be a maid.

348
00:21:39,777 --> 00:21:41,777
Ok so.

349
00:21:41,777 --> 00:21:43,777
What's wrong?

350
00:21:43,777 --> 00:21:58,777
...

351
00:21:58,777 --> 00:22:03,777
OK Iritt

352
00:23:20,967 --> 00:23:24,467
Ms. Kobayashi, I heard they'll be launching fireworks at the summer festival.

353
00:23:24,467 --> 00:23:25,467
Yeah, that's true.

354
00:23:25,467 --> 00:23:27,467
I think my breath would be more amazing, though.

355
00:23:27,467 --> 00:23:29,467
That might turn it into a blood festival.

356
00:23:29,467 --> 00:23:32,467
But the sights you see on the verge of death are so beautiful.

357
00:23:32,467 --> 00:23:34,467
Why are we talking about this?

358
00:23:35,967 --> 00:23:38,467
This week on Who's Rotten?

359
00:23:38,467 --> 00:23:39,467
Scorpio.

